        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Richard Curtis, Domhnall Gleeson, Rachel McAdams, Bill Nighy, Vanessa Kirby, Peter Morgan\n- Films and TV series: About Time, Great Expectations, The Crown\n- Organizations: BBC, Netflix, Dublin Institute of Technology\n- Roles: Estella, Joanna, Princess Margaret\n- Concepts: time travel\n\nFacts:\n- Vanessa Kirby starred as Estella in the BBC adaptation of Great Expectations in 2011.\n- About Time is a 2013 British romantic comedy-drama film about a young man who can time travel and tries to change his past to improve his future.\n- Richard Curtis wrote and directed About Time.\n- About Time stars Domhnall Gleeson, Rachel McAdams, and Bill Nighy.\n- Vanessa Kirby starred as Joanna in Richard Curtis's 2013 romantic comedy About Time.\n- Domhnall Gleeson was born on 12 May 1983 and is an Irish actor and writer.\n- Domhnall Gleeson received a Bachelor of Arts in Media Arts from Dublin Institute of Technology.\n- Vanessa Kirby portrays Princess Margaret in Peter Morgan's Netflix series The Crown.\n- Vanessa Kirby was nominated for the British Academy Television Award for Best Supporting Actress for The Crown.",
